{"id":586,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"カトリック精神と主体的な学びで自立した女性を育成","feature_description":"賢明女子学院は、カトリック精神を基盤に、他者を尊重し主体的に学ぶ女性を育てます。情報媒体や外部講師を活用した学び、英数の補習などを通して基礎学力を支え、中高合同のクラブ活動や茶道・華道・箏曲にも取り組みます。多様な人との関わりの中で、自分の考えを深め、進路を主体的に選ぶ力を養います。学びと学校生活を結び、自立して社会に関わる姿勢を目指します。","clubs":[{"id":11074,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11075,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11076,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11077,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11078,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11079,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11080,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11081,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11082,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11083,"name":"少林寺拳法部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11084,"name":"ブラスバンド部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp/life/seitokai-2011-05-20.html","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11085,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://himejikenmei.ac.jp